ce to build trust into our technology from the beginning ushered in a wide range of breakthrough in ai and wave of adoption across organization big and small these development unlocked opportunity and learning across a range of domain from science education and healthcare to retail manufacturing and agriculture they also refocused attention on effective ai governance in practice a ai innovation and adoption continue to advance our core objective remains the same earning the trust that we see a foundational to fostering broad and beneficial ai adoption around the world a we continue that journey over the next year we will focus on three area to progress our steadfast commitment to ai governance while ensuring that our effort are responsive to an ever evolving landscape developing more flexible and agile risk management tool and practice while fostering skill development to anticipate and adapt to advance in ai to ensure people and organization around the world can leverage the transformative potential of ai our ability to anticipate and manage the risk of ai must keep pace with ai innovation this requires u to build tool and practice that can quickly adapt to advance in ai capability and the growing diversity of deployment scenario that each have unique risk profile to do this we will make greater investment in our system of risk management to provide tool and practice for the most common risk across deployment scenario and also enable the sharing of test set mitigation and other best practice across team at microsoft we also need to continue investing in our employee who are at the heart of our risk management effort this will include continued investment in training to better equip our employee with the skill they need to fully participate in building and deploying trustworthy ai technology supporting effective governance across the ai supply chain building earning and keeping trust in ai is a collaborative endeavor that requires model developer app builder and sys