ort on time try these option assign additional step for the in class activity encourage student to dedicate more time to the layout style and or visual element of their deck or poster board have every student present their creative ai use plan to the class or in small group ask for volunteer to present their creative ai use plan to the class explore in more depth how ai work and the history of ai by showing the class the video experience ai teach an ai lesson from the applied digital skill curriculum explore a topic generative ai discover ai in daily life teach a lesson about evaluating the credibility of online source from the applied digital skill curriculum evaluate credibility of online source have extra time try these option after reviewing the example and scenario in the lesson plan consider way you can modify the content to align with what you re teaching for example in class discussion and instead of a research report on a beetle or an art history essay you can substitute these assignment with one that you assigned or will assign in your class you can also ask gemini to take the scenario and make them relevant to your class and what you are learning or ask it to generate alternative scenario all together need example and scenario tailored to your class try these option customize your lesson try these option available in chromebooks and google workspace for motor and dexterity support go keyboardless and use voice typing to enter edit and format text in google doc and slide for display and vision support make reading easier with reading mode which can read text aloud summarize information highlight specific line and more reduce eye strain and increase focus with dark mode on google classroom app for cognitive and spoken feedback support help student focus with google meet pinning which allows them to view just the teacher and hide other participant for audio support for remote learner turn on caption in google meet to view subtitle in real time for reading su