ond with the centre for population genomics a joint initiative between garvan and murdoch child s research institute will automate the complex genetic analysis that is currently the main bottleneck in diagnosing child with rare genetic condition separately murdoch child s research institute will also apply claude to it stem cell medicine program to improve identification of therapeutic target for childhood heart disease finally the curtin institute for data science australia s largest university based data science research institute will use claude to scale their collaboration with academic and in research project across health science the humanity business law science and engineering on monday we also announced that we are launching our first deep tech startup api credit program for vc backed startup working on drug discovery material science climate modeling and medical diagnostics area where ai can have a profound impact eligible company will receive up to usd about aud in api credit to build with claude along with resource and community support a we build our local team these investment reflect the advanced work australian researcher and startup are already doing with claude and directly contribute to supporting the goal outlined in australia s national ai plan the visit to australia mark the beginning of long term collaboration and investment into the asia pacific region we ll share more about our local team and leadership in the coming week a we prepare to open our sydney office you can read the detail of the australian government s mou with anthropic here,865,1,"[8.12772711e-309 1.43531377e-308 1.00000000e+000 1.47555768e-308
