elligence is here to stay it is developing at a tremendous pace and it is important to harness it power while at the same time preventing harm it will affect education just like other field said gu mundur ingi kristinsson minister of education and child in iceland here we take the leap and embark on an ambitious project aimed at examining the use of artificial intelligence in various area of education with the need of teacher a our guiding principle and using technology from global leader in the field i look forward to seeing the result and discussing the next step building on global momentum in education and public sector iceland s pioneering education pilot build upon a growing number of government partnering with anthropic across europe and beyond the european parliament archive unit ha deployed claude to make over million official document readily accessible reducing document search time by in the uk we ve signed a memorandum of understanding with the department for science innovation and technology to explore how ai can transform public service for uk citizen additionally the anthropic and iceland announce one of the world s first national ai education pilot side af london school of economics ha provided all student with access to claude for education helping them to solve problem and develop their critical thinking skill these partnership demonstrate how european government and institution are thoughtfully integrating ai into public service iceland s comprehensive approach focusing specifically on teacher add another model for how nation can harness ai to modernize education looking forward this partnership mark another milestone in anthropic s commitment to supporting educator and government worker globally teacher worldwide are using claude to save hour on lesson planning create personalized learning material and provide individualized support to student changing how education is delivered we re building a global network of educator student and government te